sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Member
  participant P as BudgetsPage / HomePage
  participant S as BudgetService (Angular)
  participant API as BudgetController + BudgetService (Nest)
  participant DB as SQLite
  U->>P: opens month M
  P->>S: loadMonth(householdId, M)
  S->>API: GET /api/households/:householdId/budgets?month=M
  API-->>S: 200, empty list (no limits yet)
  alt M is current or next month
    S->>API: POST /api/households/:householdId/budgets/M/copy-previous?auto=true
    API->>DB: is M in budget_month?
    alt touched before
      API-->>S: { skipped: true } → month stays empty
    else untouched
      API->>DB: latestMonthBefore(M) → source
      API->>DB: insert copies for M, mark budget_month
      API-->>S: { sourceMonth, budgets }
    end
  else any other month
    S-->>P: empty + "Take over previous limits" button
  end
  P-->>U: limits for M (with "taken over from" hint)
